cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this index, cite it alongside the urban-ecology papers it is built from. Start with Beninde, Veith and Hochkirch (2015).
title: Biodiversity potential
abstract: >-
  A QGIS screening index for biodiversity potential inside a small urban area.
  Patch area, habitat amount, connectivity, vegetation, distinctiveness, water,
  heterogeneity and interior habitat are combined on a 10 m grid from open
  Ordnance Survey, Natural England and satellite layers.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/domusight/biodiversity
authors:
  - name: Domusight
keywords:
  - biodiversity
  - urban ecology
  - QGIS
  - open data
